OL,3,GNEWSAClearing waste site 'remains goal'
OL,4,Aafter court order
OL,5,
OL,6,FClearing an unauthorised waste site
OL,7,F"remains the goal" after Environment
OL,8,FAgency action to prevent further
OL,9,Fdumping, an MP has said.
OL,11,FSurrey County Council and the agency
OL,12,Fhave been working to try to clear the
OL,13,FDorking West Station Yard site, after
OL,14,Fconcerns were raised about waste and an
OL,15,Fenforcement notice was issued in May.
OL,17,FDorking MP Chris Coghlan said he was
OL,18,F"pleased to hear there's been
OL,19,Fprogress", and hoped the site could
OL,20,Fsoon be cleared.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
